WEBVTT

00:24:57.288 --> 00:25:01.954
letting them have intuitions. But
the discovery was very clear.

00:25:02.163 --> 00:25:07.079
And we ended up with a system in which
the average of the six traits and

00:25:07.079 --> 00:25:09.329
the final intuition had equal weight.

00:25:10.371 --> 00:25:15.496
It sounds like what you recommend then
concretely is for a manager to make

00:25:15.496 --> 00:25:17.913
a list of the skills and values
that they're trying to select

00:25:17.913 --> 00:25:21.871
on to to do ratings that are anchored
on those dimensions.

00:25:21.913 --> 00:25:25.329
So, you know, I might judge somebody
who's coding skills if they're

00:25:25.329 --> 00:25:28.371
a programmer or their ability to
sell if they're a salesperson.

00:25:28.663 --> 00:25:31.288
And then I might also be interested
in whether they you know,